<title>USA: U.S. DAP, ammonia values flat, supplies adequate.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP, ammonia values flat, supplies adequate.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diammonium phosphate and ammonia values were mostly unchanged Monday, with values for both products supported by inventory building ahead of the winter wheat planting season, dealers said.</p>
<p>However, dealers said production of both fertilizers was adequate for demand.</p>
<p>				Dlrs/short ton   Chg from Friday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla		172-174		 unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf	  185-188		 unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf		175		     unc</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
